        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python file named `moderate_text.py` that scores user text for unsafe or policy-violating content using a concrete external provider. The provider must be identifiable in the code. I will use the Amazon Comprehend service, which is a natural language processing (NLP) service that uses machine learning to find insights and relationships in text. </thinking>\n",
